    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/7a331355906a6420947095958f9751db.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong><i>Malpractice</i></strong> is an <strong>Online Co-Op Horror Experience</strong> for up to <strong>4 players</strong>. You and your friends wake up in a plagued hospital where a terrible virus has begun to spread. Your task is find a way out, and not lose your life in the process. <strong>Solve puzzles, Discover secrets</strong>, and <strong>avoid corrupted entities</strong> as you uncover the mystery behind the outbreak. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/a285a0e1db822ce36c7a9a672564c972.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>The spread of the virus has fatal effects on most hosts, however a small few cases yielded horrifying outcomes as its host becomes terribly mutated and animalistic in its attempt to fight off the virus, You and your friends will need to be careful as you make your way throughout the hospital. Something could be lurking behind any corner.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/f27d47314bf90cfe33c417dbb13b7565.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>In an attempt to halt the rapid spread of the virus, the hospital has gone in to a lockdown protocol. In combination with avoiding the looming threats throughout the various rooms and halls, You and your friend will need to solve various unique puzzles and piece together clues in order to make your way to safety.<br><br>Utilize the <strong>Inventory system</strong> to collect and distribute key items, tools, and weaponry that will aid you in finding a way out. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/ae83fd0f188133e0c798e98e7cf23faf.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>Play alongside up to 4 friends and work together to discover a way out. With a vast set of puzzles within the game, each player is likely to experience a new set of challenges on each playthrough. Proximity voice chat is included, allowing players to join and interact not only with their friends, but with anyone looking to play.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/7a331355906a6420947095958f9751db.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong><i>Malpractice</i></strong> is an <strong>Online Co-Op Horror Experience</strong> for up to <strong>4 players</strong>. You and your friends wake up in a plagued hospital where a terrible virus has begun to spread. Your task is find a way out, and not lose your life in the process. <strong>Solve puzzles, Discover secrets</strong>, and <strong>avoid corrupted entities</strong> as you uncover the mystery behind the outbreak. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/a285a0e1db822ce36c7a9a672564c972.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>The spread of the virus has fatal effects on most hosts, however a small few cases yielded horrifying outcomes as its host becomes terribly mutated and animalistic in its attempt to fight off the virus, You and your friends will need to be careful as you make your way throughout the hospital. Something could be lurking behind any corner.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/f27d47314bf90cfe33c417dbb13b7565.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>In an attempt to halt the rapid spread of the virus, the hospital has gone in to a lockdown protocol. In combination with avoiding the looming threats throughout the various rooms and halls, You and your friend will need to solve various unique puzzles and piece together clues in order to make your way to safety.<br><br>Utilize the <strong>Inventory system</strong> to collect and distribute key items, tools, and weaponry that will aid you in finding a way out. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203040/extras/ae83fd0f188133e0c798e98e7cf23faf.avif?t=1730253560\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>Play alongside up to 4 friends and work together to discover a way out. With a vast set of puzzles within the game, each player is likely to experience a new set of challenges on each playthrough. Proximity voice chat is included, allowing players to join and interact not only with their friends, but with anyone looking to play.",
